## Test Anti-Pattern Audit — Severity-Ranked Findings

This test file is a textbook case of **"coverage without verification"** — every production method is exercised (achieving line coverage) but almost nothing meaningful is asserted.

---

### 🔴 Critical — Tests that cannot catch regressions

| # | Test | Anti-Pattern | What breaks undetected |
|---|------|-------------|----------------------|
| 1 | `AddProduct_Works` (L17-21) | **No assertion at all** — fire-and-forget | `Save()` could silently no-op; duplicates never caught |
| 2 | `UpdatePrice_Works` (L32-35) | **No assertion** — calls `UpdatePrice` but never checks the price changed | Price logic `p.Price * (1 - fraction)` could be wrong; old price persists |
| 3 | `RemoveProduct_Works` (L38-42) | **No assertion** — never verifies the product is actually gone | `Delete` could silently fail |
| 4 | `GetProductCount_Works` (L63-66) | **No assertion** — result isn't even inspected | Could return -1 and pass |
| 5 | `ApplyBulkDiscount_Works` (L68-74) | **No assertion** — the most complex logic in the class is completely unverified | Discount formula, rounding, multi-product iteration — all untested |
| 6 | `ImportFromCsv_Works` (L84-88) | **No assertion** — never checks products were persisted | CSV parsing could silently corrupt data |

---

### 🟠 High — Tests with assertions too weak to catch bugs

| # | Test | Anti-Pattern | Fix |
|---|------|-------------|-----|
| 7 | `GetProduct_Works` (L26-29) | **Assert.IsNotNull only** — doesn't verify name, SKU, or price | A product with wrong fields still passes |
| 8 | `SearchProducts_Works` (L46-52) | **Assert.IsNotNull on list** — doesn't check count or contents | Search returning *all* products or wrong products passes |
| 9 | `GetAllProducts_Works` (L55-60) | **Assert.IsNotNull on list** — doesn't verify count | An empty list passes |
| 10 | `ExportToCsv_Works` (L77-82) | **Assert.IsNotNull on string** — empty string passes | Malformed CSV format undetected |

---

### 🟡 Medium — Structural/design issues

| # | Issue | Impact |
|---|-------|--------|
| 11 | **No negative/edge-case tests** — missing: `UpdatePrice` on nonexistent SKU (should throw `KeyNotFoundException`), `GetProduct` for missing SKU (should return null), empty CSV, malformed CSV | Production exceptions go untested |
| 12 | **No boundary tests** — `ApplyBulkDiscount(1.0m)` (free), `ApplyBulkDiscount(0m)` (no-op), negative fractions | Logical edge cases live only in prod |

---

### Concrete Fixes (examples)

```csharp
